  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The days",
   "texto": [
    "The days are written with **minúscula**. Without article, **lundi** usually refers to a specific Monday; the context indicates which. With article, **le lundi** usually expresses a custom: «on Monday».",
    "**Aujourd'hui** = today. **Le week-end** = the weekend; in a routine it may amount to «on weekends»."
   ]
  },
